WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.280
Failure semantics are
part of the interface.

00:00:02.353 --> 00:00:06.880
After an unknown result, inspect status
before retrying instead of launching

00:00:06.936 --> 00:00:11.200
duplicate work. Stale policy
requires renewed authorization.

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:13.441
Missing evidence holds promotion.

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:18.000
A changed artifact or oracle
invalidates old evaluation results.

00:00:18.133 --> 00:00:22.880
Recovery proceeds through an owned queue
and the failing scenario is exercised

00:00:22.937 --> 00:00:26.400
before resumption. These
behaviors keep an unavailable

00:00:26.458 --> 00:00:29.760
dependency from becoming
an unexplained success.
